+therefore proves
+\[
+\begin{gathered}
+ \mathcal E_{\mathscr R}=\Lambda_U\oplus U_{\boldsymbol\rho}F,
+ \qquad \Lambda_U=\bigoplus_{r=0}^D\mathscr R W_r,\\
+ L_U:=\eta_{\boldsymbol\rho}(\mathcal C_{\mathscr R})
